IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `saa-student`
IMPORT `saa-regulations`

-- Student Assistance Regulations 2021 -- worked cases, from the ABSTUDY recipient's seat (REQ-0096). Expected values were
-- written by hand from the deposited Regulations (Compilation No. 1, F2022C00508), never copied from the encoding's output.
-- All facts are HYPOTHETICAL.

-- A university student on ABSTUDY drops from full-time to half a load on 3 March 2027: report by 17 March 2027.
#ASSERT `Must I report this ABSTUDY change` `I am the student, with independent status` `a tertiary or secondary non-school student's study load fell below three-quarters of full-time` (Date 3 3 2027) EQUALS `yes: I must notify the Department, as the regulations require, by` (Date 17 3 2027)
-- She moves into a share house while on rent assistance.
#ASSERT `Must I report this ABSTUDY change` `I am the student, with independent status` `the student, on rent assistance, started living with someone or in government housing for which rent is payable` (Date 3 3 2027) EQUALS `yes: I must notify the Department, as the regulations require, by` (Date 17 3 2027)
-- She starts a relationship: prescribed for an independent student...
#ASSERT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with independent status` `someone became or stopped being the student's partner`
-- ...but not where the payee is a dependent student or a parent (reg 14(1) only).
#ASSERT NOT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with dependent status` `someone became or stopped being the student's partner`
-- A step-parent joins the family of a dependent student: prescribed (reg 14(2)); for an independent student: not.
#ASSERT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with dependent status` `someone became a parent of the student`
#ASSERT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am a parent of the student, receiving it for the student` `someone became a parent of the student`
#ASSERT NOT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with independent status` `someone became a parent of the student`
-- A parent's income will exceed the estimate by 30%: prescribed for a dependent student or a parent payee (reg 19).
#ASSERT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am a parent of the student, receiving it for the student` `a parent's income for the year exceeded, or will exceed, the estimate by 25% or more`
#ASSERT NOT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with independent status` `a parent's income for the year exceeded, or will exceed, the estimate by 25% or more`
-- Assets over the limit: only for an independent student (reg 20).
#ASSERT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with independent status` `the student's (or the student and partner's) assets exceed the personal assets test limit`
#ASSERT NOT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with dependent status` `the student's (or the student and partner's) assets exceed the personal assets test limit`
-- The student's death: a parent payee must report it (reg 21(2)).
#ASSERT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am a parent of the student, receiving it for the student` `the student died`
-- Overseas travel, custody, leaving a job: prescribed for every payee.
#ASSERT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with dependent status` `the student will be outside Australia`
#ASSERT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with dependent status` `the student was taken into lawful custody`
#ASSERT `Is this a prescribed ABSTUDY event` `I am the student, with independent status` `the student stopped working in a job`
-- A new phone number is not prescribed: nothing to report under s 48.
#ASSERT `Must I report this ABSTUDY change` `I am the student, with independent status` `something else` (Date 3 3 2027) EQUALS `no: s 48 does not require me to notify the Department of this event`

-- The duty as a rule (days). Reported on day 10: FULFILLED. On day 20: BREACH.
#TRACE `the s 48 duty` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `I, the ABSTUDY payee` DOES `notify Services Australia of the event` AT 10
#TRACE `the s 48 duty` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `I, the ABSTUDY payee` DOES `notify Services Australia of the event` AT 20
